{"strongs": "H5797", "word": "עֹז", "translit": "oz", "root": "עור", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "strength, might", "definition": "עֹז , and (rarely) עוֺז noun masculine strength, might ; — absolute ׳ ע Judg 9:51 +, עוֺז Ps 84:6 +, עָזֿ Isa 26:1 , once עָ֑ז Gen 49:3 construct עֹז Mic 5:3 +, עָזֿ Ps 28:8 suffix עָזִּי Exod 15:2 + 2 t., עֻזִּי Ps 28:7 +; עָזְּךָ Ps 21:2 + 2 t., עֻזְּךָ Ps 66:3 +; suffix 1 plural עוּזֵנוּ Ps 81:2 3 masculine plural עֻזָּמוּ Ps 89:18 , etc.; — strength, might (usually in poetry, 44 t. Psalms): 1. material and physical, מִגְדַּלעֹֿז Judg 9:51 , and figurative (of ׳ י ), Ps 61:4 ; Prov 18:10 , מַחֲסִיעֹֿז Ps 71:7 , compare עִיר עָזלָֿנוּ Isa 26:1 , קִרְיַתעֹֿז Prov 18:19 (simile), Prov 10:15 = Prov 18:11 (figurative); עֹז מִבְטֶחָ֑ה Prov 21:22 (of a city, read possibly מעוז Toy); צוּר עֻזִּי Ps 62:8 (figurative); מְרוֺם עֻזָּהּ Jer 51:53 (of Babylonian ), מַצְּבוֺת עֻזֵּךְ Ezek 26:11 (of Tyre), compare Ps 30:8 (reading לְהַרְרֵיעֹֿז ᵑ7 Hup Che Kau We ; but no object for verb; Gie in Bae proposes הָעֳמַדְתִּי for הֶעֱמַדְתָּה ); רְקִיעַ עֻזּוֺ Ps 150:1 his mighty firmament ( De Hup Kau and others; Ki AV RV Che the f. of his power , where his power dwells); בְּכָלעֹֿז with all one's might 2Sam 6:14 = 1Chr 13:8 , + 2Chr 30:21 (where so read, for ᵑ0 כְּלֵי עֹז , Kau Kit compare Be Oettli); בְּעוֺז Prov 31:17 ; Prov 31:25 abstract for concrete Judg 5:21 si vera lectio, but probably corrupt, compare GFM Bu ; of crocodile Job 41:14 קוֺל עֹז Ps 68:34 a might voice ; זְרוֺעַ עֻזּוֺ = his mighty arm (figurative of ׳ י ) Isa 62:8 , compare Isa 51:9 ; Ps 89:11 ; Job 26:2 , גֶּשֶׁם מִטְרוֺת עֻזּוֺ Job 37:6 מַטֵּהעֹֿז , figurative of political power Jer 48:17 (|| מַקֵּל תִּפְאָרָה ), Ezek 19:11 ; Ezek 19:12 ; Ezek 19:14 (vine-branches, in figure), Ps 110:2 . 2. personal, social, and political: \\ \\ a. Amos 3:11 , ׳ גְּאוֺן ע Lev 26:19 ( H ), Ezek 24:21 ; Ezek 30:6 ; Ezek 30:18 ; Ezek 33:28 . \\ \\ b. bestowed by ׳ י , 1Sam 2:10 (song), Ps 29:11 ; Ps 68:36 ; Ps 86:16 ; Ps 138:3 , עוֺזלֿוֺ בָ֑ךְ Ps 84:6 ; Ps 138:3 so (implicit) of Zion Isa 52:1 . \\ \\ c. of ׳ י as strength of his servants Mic 5:3 ; Isa 49:5 ; Ps 81:2 ; Ps 84:6 , also Exod 15:2 (|| יְשׁוּעָה ) = Isa 12:2 = Ps 118:14 , compare Isa 45:24 , עֹז יְשׁוּעָתִי Ps 140:8 , תִּפְאֶרֶת עֻזָּמוֺ Ps 89:18 sometimes as their stronghold, for defence Jer 16:19 (+ מָעֻזִּי ), Ps 28:7 (+ מָגִנִּי ), v Ps 28:8 (|| מָעוֺז ), Ps 46:2 (+ מַחֲסֶה ), Ps 59:10 (reading עֻזִּי , see Commentaries and Ginsb margin ; || מִשְׂגַּבִּי ), v Ps 59:18 (|| id. ), compare Prov 14:26 (|| מַחְסֶה ); see also below 1. — Prov 24:5 see עַז . 3. might of ׳ י (especially Psalms): \\ \\ a. as essential attribute Hab 3:4 ; Job 12:16 ; Ps 62:12 ; Ps 63:3 ; Ps 68:35 ; Ps 93:1 ; Ps 96:6 = 1Chr 16:27 עֹז מֶלֶךְ Ps 99:4 (title of ׳ י ). \\ \\ b. theme of ascription in praise Ps 29:1 (c. יָהַב ) = Ps 96:7 = 1Chr 16:28 ; Ps 59:17 (with שִׁיר ), Ps 68:35 (with נָתַן ). \\ \\ c. exerted for his people and against his foes Exod 15:13 (song), Ps 21:2 (|| יְשׁוּעָה ), v Ps 21:14 ; Ps 66:3 ; Ps 68:29 + v Ps 68:29 (reading עוֺז for עוּזָּה , see עזז ), Ps 74:13 ; Ps 77:15 ; Ps 78:26 ; Ps 105:4 = 1Chr 16:11 ; Ezra 8:22 (+ אַפּוֺ ), compare עֹז אַפֶּ֑ךָ Ps 90:11 . \\ \\ d. manifested in connection with the ark, אֲרוֺן עֻזֶּ֑ךָ 2Chr 6:41 = Ps 132:8 , עֹז = ark Ps 78:61 . 4. עֹז פָּנָיו = boldness, impudence Eccl 8:1 , changed by wisdom, De Wild and others; < read ׳ עַז פ he who is impudent ᵐ5 Siegf (compare עזז Hiph`il ). 5. = stronghold (compare 2 c ): Ps 8:3 out of the mouth of babes . . . thou hast founded strength, or a stronghold (for thy defence, compare v b ), so Ew De Hup Kau Sch Che Dr , compare Du ; > praise Vrss Bae . — מָעוֺז see עוז .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5945')\">BDB5945</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H5797')\">H5797</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5944')\">BDB5944</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5946')\">BDB5946</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>עֹז</bdbheb>, and (rarely) <bdbheb>עוֺז</bdbheb> <b>noun masculine</b> <highlightword>strength, might</highlightword>; — absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 9:51\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"51\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"51\" onclick=\"bcv(7,9,51)\">Judg 9:51</ref> +, <bdbheb>עוֺז</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 84:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"84\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"84\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,84,6)\">Ps 84:6</ref> +, <bdbheb>עָזֿ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 26:1\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(23,26,1)\">Isa 26:1</ref>, once <bdbheb>עָ֑ז</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 49:3\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(1,49,3)\">Gen 49:3</ref> construct <bdbheb>עֹז</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Mic 5:3\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(33,5,3)\">Mic 5:3</ref> +, <bdbheb>עָזֿ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 28:8\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(19,28,8)\">Ps 28:8</ref> suffix <bdbheb>עָזִּי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 15:2\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(2,15,2)\">Exod 15:2</ref> + 2 t., <bdbheb>עֻזִּי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 28:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,28,7)\">Ps 28:7</ref> +; <bdbheb>עָזְּךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 21:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,21,2)\">Ps 21:2</ref> + 2 t., <bdbheb>עֻזְּךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 66:3\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"66\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"66\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(19,66,3)\">Ps 66:3</ref> +; suffix 1 plural <bdbheb>עוּזֵנוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 81:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"81\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"81\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,81,2)\">Ps 81:2</ref> 3 masculine plural <bdbheb>עֻזָּמוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 89:18\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"89\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"89\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(19,89,18)\">Ps 89:18</ref>, etc.; — <highlight>strength, might</highlight> (usually in poetry, 44 t. Psalms): <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> material and physical, <bdbheb>מִגְדַּלעֹֿז</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 9:51\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"51\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"51\" onclick=\"bcv(7,9,51)\">Judg 9:51</ref>, and figurative (of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Ps 61:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"61\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"61\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,61,4)\">Ps 61:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 18:10\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(20,18,10)\">Prov 18:10</ref>, <bdbheb>מַחֲסִיעֹֿז</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 71:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"71\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"71\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,71,7)\">Ps 71:7</ref>, compare <bdbheb>עִיר עָזלָֿנוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 26:1\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(23,26,1)\">Isa 26:1</ref>, <bdbheb>קִרְיַתעֹֿז</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 18:19\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(20,18,19)\">Prov 18:19</ref> (simile), <ref ref=\"Prov 10:15\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(20,10,15)\">Prov 10:15</ref> = <ref ref=\"Prov 18:11\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(20,18,11)\">Prov 18:11</ref> (figurative); <bdbheb>עֹז מִבְטֶחָ֑ה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 21:22\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(20,21,22)\">Prov 21:22</ref> (of a city, read possibly <bdbheb>מעוז</bdbheb> Toy); <bdbheb>צוּר עֻזִּי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 62:8\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"62\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"62\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(19,62,8)\">Ps 62:8</ref> (figurative); <bdbheb>מְרוֺם עֻזָּהּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 51:53\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"51\" vBegin=\"53\" cEnd=\"51\" vEnd=\"53\" onclick=\"bcv(24,51,53)\">Jer 51:53</ref> (of Babylonian ), <bdbheb>מַצְּבוֺת עֻזֵּךְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 26:11\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(26,26,11)\">Ezek 26:11</ref> (of Tyre), compare <ref ref=\"Ps 30:8\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(19,30,8)\">Ps 30:8</ref> (reading <bdbheb>לְהַרְרֵיעֹֿז</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Tg')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ7</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Hup')\">Hup</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Che')\">Che</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kau')\">Kau</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('We')\">We</lookup>; but no object for verb; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Gie')\">Gie</lookup> in <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Bae')\">Bae</lookup> proposes <bdbheb>הָעֳמַדְתִּי</bdbheb> for <bdbheb>הֶעֱמַדְתָּה</bdbheb>); <bdbheb>רְקִיעַ עֻזּוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 150:1\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"150\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"150\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(19,150,1)\">Ps 150:1</ref><highlight>his mighty firmament</highlight> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('De')\">De</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Hup')\">Hup</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kau')\">Kau</lookup> and others; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ki')\">Ki</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('AV')\"><reflink>AV</reflink></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('RV')\"><reflink>RV</reflink></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Che')\">Che</lookup> <highlight>the f. of his power</highlight>, where his power dwells); <bdbheb>בְּכָלעֹֿז</bdbheb> <highlight>with all one's might</highlight> <ref ref=\"2Sam 6:14\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(10,6,14)\">2Sam 6:14</ref> = <ref ref=\"1Chr 13:8\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(13,13,8)\">1Chr 13:8</ref>, + <ref ref=\"2Chr 30:21\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(14,30,21)\">2Chr 30:21</ref> (where so read, for <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('MT')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ0</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <bdbheb>כְּלֵי עֹז</bdbheb>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kau')\">Kau</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kit')\">Kit</lookup> compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Be')\">Be</lookup> Oettli); <bdbheb>בְּעוֺז</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 31:17\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(20,31,17)\">Prov 31:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 31:25\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(20,31,25)\">Prov 31:25</ref> abstract for concrete <ref ref=\"Judg 5:21\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(7,5,21)\">Judg 5:21</ref> si vera lectio, but probably corrupt, compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('GFM')\">GFM</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Bu')\">Bu</lookup>; of crocodile <ref ref=\"Job 41:14\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(18,41,14)\">Job 41:14</ref> <bdbheb>קוֺל עֹז</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 68:34\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"68\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"68\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(19,68,34)\">Ps 68:34</ref> <highlight>a might voice</highlight>; <bdbheb>זְרוֺעַ עֻזּוֺ</bdbheb> = <highlight>his mighty arm</highlight> (figurative of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"Isa 62:8\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"62\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"62\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(23,62,8)\">Isa 62:8</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Isa 51:9\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"51\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"51\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(23,51,9)\">Isa 51:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 89:11\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"89\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"89\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(19,89,11)\">Ps 89:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 26:2\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(18,26,2)\">Job 26:2</ref>, <bdbheb>גֶּשֶׁם מִטְרוֺת עֻזּוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 37:6\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(18,37,6)\">Job 37:6</ref> <bdbheb>מַטֵּהעֹֿז</bdbheb>, figurative of political power <ref ref=\"Jer 48:17\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"48\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"48\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(24,48,17)\">Jer 48:17</ref> (|| <bdbheb>מַקֵּל תִּפְאָרָה</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Ezek 19:11\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(26,19,11)\">Ezek 19:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 19:12\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(26,19,12)\">Ezek 19:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 19:14\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(26,19,14)\">Ezek 19:14</ref> (vine-branches, in figure), <ref ref=\"Ps 110:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"110\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"110\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,110,2)\">Ps 110:2</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> personal, social, and political: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> <ref ref=\"Amos 3:11\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(30,3,11)\">Amos 3:11</ref>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>גְּאוֺן ע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 26:19\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(3,26,19)\">Lev 26:19</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('H')\"><reflink>H</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Ezek 24:21\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(26,24,21)\">Ezek 24:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 30:6\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(26,30,6)\">Ezek 30:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 30:18\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(26,30,18)\">Ezek 30:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 33:28\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(26,33,28)\">Ezek 33:28</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> bestowed by <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"1Sam 2:10\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(9,2,10)\">1Sam 2:10</ref> (song), <ref ref=\"Ps 29:11\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(19,29,11)\">Ps 29:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 68:36\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"68\" vBegin=\"36\" cEnd=\"68\" vEnd=\"36\" onclick=\"bcv(19,68,36)\">Ps 68:36</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 86:16\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"86\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"86\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(19,86,16)\">Ps 86:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 138:3\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"138\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"138\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(19,138,3)\">Ps 138:3</ref>, <bdbheb>עוֺזלֿוֺ בָ֑ךְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 84:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"84\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"84\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,84,6)\">Ps 84:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 138:3\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"138\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"138\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(19,138,3)\">Ps 138:3</ref> so (implicit) of Zion <ref ref=\"Isa 52:1\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"52\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"52\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(23,52,1)\">Isa 52:1</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> as strength of his servants <ref ref=\"Mic 5:3\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(33,5,3)\">Mic 5:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 49:5\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(23,49,5)\">Isa 49:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 81:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"81\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"81\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,81,2)\">Ps 81:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 84:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"84\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"84\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,84,6)\">Ps 84:6</ref>, also <ref ref=\"Exod 15:2\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(2,15,2)\">Exod 15:2</ref> (|| <bdbheb>יְשׁוּעָה</bdbheb>) = <ref ref=\"Isa 12:2\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(23,12,2)\">Isa 12:2</ref> = <ref ref=\"Ps 118:14\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"118\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"118\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(19,118,14)\">Ps 118:14</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Isa 45:24\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(23,45,24)\">Isa 45:24</ref>, <bdbheb>עֹז יְשׁוּעָתִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 140:8\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"140\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"140\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(19,140,8)\">Ps 140:8</ref>, <bdbheb>תִּפְאֶרֶת עֻזָּמוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 89:18\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"89\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"89\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(19,89,18)\">Ps 89:18</ref> sometimes as their stronghold, for defence <ref ref=\"Jer 16:19\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(24,16,19)\">Jer 16:19</ref> (+ <bdbheb>מָעֻזִּי</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Ps 28:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,28,7)\">Ps 28:7</ref> (+ <bdbheb>מָגִנִּי</bdbheb>), v<ref ref=\"Ps 28:8\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(19,28,8)\">Ps 28:8</ref> (|| <bdbheb>מָעוֺז</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Ps 46:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,46,2)\">Ps 46:2</ref> (+ <bdbheb>מַחֲסֶה</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Ps 59:10\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"59\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"59\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(19,59,10)\">Ps 59:10</ref> (reading <bdbheb>עֻזִּי</bdbheb>, see Commentaries and <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Gi')\">Ginsb<sup>margin</sup></lookup>; || <bdbheb>מִשְׂגַּבִּי</bdbheb>), v<ref ref=\"Ps 59:18\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"59\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"59\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(19,59,18)\">Ps 59:18</ref> (|| <highlight>id.</highlight>), compare <ref ref=\"Prov 14:26\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(20,14,26)\">Prov 14:26</ref> (|| <bdbheb>מַחְסֶה</bdbheb>); see also below </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> — <ref ref=\"Prov 24:5\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(20,24,5)\">Prov 24:5</ref> see  <bdbheb><reflink>עַז</reflink></bdbheb>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <highlight>might</highlight> of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> (especially Psalms): <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> as essential attribute <ref ref=\"Hab 3:4\" b=\"35\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(35,3,4)\">Hab 3:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 12:16\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(18,12,16)\">Job 12:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 62:12\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"62\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"62\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(19,62,12)\">Ps 62:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 63:3\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"63\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"63\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(19,63,3)\">Ps 63:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 68:35\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"68\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"68\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(19,68,35)\">Ps 68:35</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 93:1\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"93\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"93\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(19,93,1)\">Ps 93:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 96:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"96\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"96\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,96,6)\">Ps 96:6</ref> = <ref ref=\"1Chr 16:27\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(13,16,27)\">1Chr 16:27</ref> <bdbheb>עֹז מֶלֶךְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 99:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"99\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"99\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,99,4)\">Ps 99:4</ref> (title of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> theme of ascription in praise <ref ref=\"Ps 29:1\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(19,29,1)\">Ps 29:1</ref> (c.<bdbheb>יָהַב</bdbheb>) = <ref ref=\"Ps 96:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"96\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"96\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,96,7)\">Ps 96:7</ref> = <ref ref=\"1Chr 16:28\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(13,16,28)\">1Chr 16:28</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 59:17\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"59\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"59\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(19,59,17)\">Ps 59:17</ref> (with <bdbheb>שִׁיר</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Ps 68:35\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"68\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"68\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(19,68,35)\">Ps 68:35</ref> (with <bdbheb>נָתַן</bdbheb>). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> exerted for his people and against his foes <ref ref=\"Exod 15:13\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(2,15,13)\">Exod 15:13</ref> (song), <ref ref=\"Ps 21:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,21,2)\">Ps 21:2</ref> (|| <bdbheb>יְשׁוּעָה</bdbheb>), v<ref ref=\"Ps 21:14\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(19,21,14)\">Ps 21:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 66:3\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"66\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"66\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(19,66,3)\">Ps 66:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 68:29\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"68\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"68\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(19,68,29)\">Ps 68:29</ref> + v<ref ref=\"Ps 68:29\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"68\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"68\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(19,68,29)\">Ps 68:29</ref> (reading <bdbheb>עוֺז</bdbheb> for <bdbheb>עוּזָּה</bdbheb>, see  <bdbheb><reflink>עזז</reflink></bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Ps 74:13\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"74\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"74\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(19,74,13)\">Ps 74:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 77:15\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"77\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"77\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(19,77,15)\">Ps 77:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 78:26\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"78\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"78\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(19,78,26)\">Ps 78:26</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 105:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"105\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"105\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,105,4)\">Ps 105:4</ref> = <ref ref=\"1Chr 16:11\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(13,16,11)\">1Chr 16:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezra 8:22\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(15,8,22)\">Ezra 8:22</ref> (+ <bdbheb>אַפּוֺ</bdbheb>), compare <bdbheb>עֹז אַפֶּ֑ךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 90:11\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"90\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"90\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(19,90,11)\">Ps 90:11</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>d.</b> manifested in connection with the ark, <bdbheb>אֲרוֺן עֻזֶּ֑ךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 6:41\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"41\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"41\" onclick=\"bcv(14,6,41)\">2Chr 6:41</ref>= <ref ref=\"Ps 132:8\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"132\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"132\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(19,132,8)\">Ps 132:8</ref>, <bdbheb>עֹז</bdbheb> = ark <ref ref=\"Ps 78:61\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"78\" vBegin=\"61\" cEnd=\"78\" vEnd=\"61\" onclick=\"bcv(19,78,61)\">Ps 78:61</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> <bdbheb>עֹז פָּנָיו</bdbheb> = <highlight>boldness, impudence</highlight> <ref ref=\"Eccl 8:1\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(21,8,1)\">Eccl 8:1</ref>, changed by wisdom, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('De')\">De</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Wild')\">Wild</lookup> and others; &lt; read <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>עַז פ</bdbheb> <highlight>he who is impudent</highlight> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Siegf')\">Siegf</lookup> (compare <bdbheb>עזז</bdbheb> <b>Hiph`il</b>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>5.</b> = <highlight>stronghold</highlight> (compare <b>2 c</b>): <ref ref=\"Ps 8:3\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(19,8,3)\">Ps 8:3</ref> <highlight>out of the mouth of babes . . . thou hast founded strength, or a stronghold</highlight> (for thy defence, compare v<sup>b</sup>), so <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ew')\">Ew</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('De')\">De</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Hup')\">Hup</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kau')\">Kau</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sch')\">Sch</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Che')\">Che</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr</lookup>, compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Du')\">Du</lookup>; &gt; <highlight>praise</highlight> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Vrss')\"><reflink>Vrss</reflink></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Bae')\">Bae</lookup>. — <bdbheb>מָעוֺז</bdbheb> see  <bdbheb><reflink>עוז</reflink></bdbheb>. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Judg 9:51", "book": "JDG", "chapter": 9, "verse": 51}, {"raw": "Ps 84:6", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 84, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "Isa 26:1", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 26, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "Gen 49:3", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 49, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Mic 5:3", "book": "MIC", "chapter": 5